//! A feature-rich interpreter that executes language programs with:
//! - Nested environments and fast variable caches
//! - Builtins for collections, IO, JSON, time, and system utilities
//! - Promise microtask queue, timers, and simple async/concurrency primitives
//! - Formatting utilities and structured error handling
//! - REPL support and module loader with import semantics
//!
//! The runtime favors clarity and debuggability while providing hooks for
//! performance (memoization, tail-call optimizations in `backends::recursion_opt`).
//! It also exposes memory stats for CLI reporting.

